F(X,Y)=sum f_rs*X^r*Y^s,    G(X,Y)=sum g_rs*X^r*Y^s,
A(gamma)=sum_(r=0)^(v-1) a_r*gamma^r,
Xtilde=beta*(gamma^(-u)-e-A(gamma)-pi*gamma^v),
Ytilde=gamma^(-u).
