charged order_basis_full.closed_form (the ℓ-boundary case).  At s'>=3 the
outer roots of h sit in D'_2,...,D'_{s'}, so B_tight = V'_2 δ'_1 + u' δ'_2
is only a floor of the true order; cutting by it is a strict sub-slice
