The necessary receiver (no two-point leading-form fix, no root-partition
slice, no tot-degree envelope) is:

    h = y^{K'} + sum_{D1, tot<=K', (a,b)!=(0,K')} h_{a,b} x^a y^b
    P = h^{e'} + sum_i α_i h^{e'-i},   Q = h^{q'} + sum_{i>=2} β_i h^{q'-i}
    J(P,Q) = c · x^ℓ,  c ≠ 0.

